    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The mark ゛ makes the consonant voiced; ゜ turns h into p.",
     "texto": [
      "The two little dashes ゛ change か into が, さ into ざ and た into だ. The little circle ゜ changes は into ぱ. It does not change the vowel.",
      "がっこう で がくせい が べんきょう します。 (The students study at school.)",
      "がくせい は ぱん を たべます。 (The student eats bread.)"
     ],
